BioCAD contains no vendored third-party source code. Every library below is
resolved at build time by vcpkg (`vcpkg.json`) or is a Windows platform
component. Data sources are either referenced by a URL in the source or cited
inside `assets/packs/**/*.json`. Two third-party *data* files are redistributed
here in transcribed form - the Wildman-Crippen atom-class parameter table in
`assets/packs/descriptors/crippen.json`, taken from RDKit's BSD-3-Clause
`Data/Crippen.txt`; the NIST SRD 144 isotope table in
`assets/packs/descriptors/isotopes.json`, a US Government public-domain work; the
CC BY 4.0 IMGT reference sequences and numbering-correspondence tables in
`assets/packs/biologics/imgt-reference.json` and
`assets/packs/biologics/scheme-maps.json`; and the BSD-3-Clause Biopython
amino-acid scales in `assets/packs/biologics/descriptors.json` - all of which are
covered in section 4a below. Only the NIST table is obligation-free. No other
third-party dataset is redistributed.


